{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>הוקם</b> Three times in the Masorah: הוקם המשכן · הוקם על גבי דוד · הוקם את דברי יהונדב בן רכב. In the merit that David established the Temple, as written, \"See now, I dwell in a house of cedars\" etc., and established upon the sons of Jehonadab son of Rechab who upheld the words of their father — they merited what is stated: \"No man of Jehonadab son of Rechab shall be cut off, standing before Me all the days.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:18.222717023Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}